n\"Continuous integration is configured.\", when the last run did not succeed.\nEvery repository in the catalogue was green until PatelHem arrived, so the\ngap was invisible until a new repo hit it — and then unmatchedClaims() failed\nthe test gate and blocked the survey from committing. Matching the shared\nprefix fixes it, which is what `container` already did for its two renderings.\n\nAdded a test that pins both alternates of every two-way template, so the next\none fails at desk instead of in the workflow.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-09-05T13:18:01Z","author":{"name":"Hem Patel","email":"patelhem60@gmail.com"},"committer":{"name":"Hem Patel","email":"patelhem60@gmail.com"}},"repository":{"id":1356848983,"node_id":"R_kgDOUN_fVw","name":"PatelHem","full_name":"Hem60/PatelHem","private":false,"owner":{"login":"Hem60","id":227198061,"node_id":"U_kgDODYrEbQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/227198061?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hem60","html_url":"https://github.com/Hem60","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hem60/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hem60/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hem60/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hem60/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hem60/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hem60/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hem60/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hem60/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hem60/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hem60/PatelHem","description":"A self-classifying engineering portfolio. Instruments read the repositories, score them on five fixed axes, and publish a catalogue that revises itself. Every rank is computed; nothing