m/users/Hem60/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hem60/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hem60/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hem60/PatelHem/actions/runs/33861094856/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hem60/PatelHem/actions/runs/33861094856/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hem60/PatelHem/check-suites/91766233713","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hem60/PatelHem/actions/runs/33861094856/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hem60/PatelHem/actions/runs/33861094856/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hem60/PatelHem/actions/runs/33861094856/rerun","previous_attempt_url":null,"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hem60/PatelHem/actions/workflows/350053545","head_commit":{"id":"a1bc388a60ac702da94859b456f457c8a734c972","tree_id":"b80d7cdf6a2c0936734f9f4b0f11e8a807d58c80","message":"Add the survey workflow, a dispatch button, and .gitattributes\n\nThe workflow described in CLAUDE.md did not exist. It does now:\nworkflow_dispatch only, no schedule — a catalogue that rewrites itself nightly\nmakes `generated` meaningless and every commit it produces is noise.\n\nTwo things the workflow has to get right:\n\n  - phase00/gh.mjs caches every API response to disk and returns the file on\n    the next read, and that cache is committed. A run that left it in place\n    would replay a survey from August and report it as today's. The cache is\n    cleared before collecting, which is what makes this an actual reading.\n\n  - the engine and pipeline test suites run before the commit step, so a\n    survey that produced a broken catalogue fails instead of publishing it.\n\nThe site links to the workflow rather than POSTing to it. Firing a workflow\nneeds a token with `actions: write`; behind a public endpoint that would let\nany visitor spend the account's Actions minutes and push commits here.\n\n.gitattributes is unrelated but was found the hard way: autocrlf had checked\nout tokens.css and system.test.ts as CRLF, which broke the contrast parser\n(it matches a two-line selector) and stopped a test file parsing. Both were\nsilent until the tooling ran. An engine meant to be reproducible by anyone\nwho clones it has to include its line endings.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-09-04T09:27:27Z","author":{"name":"Hem Patel","email":"patelhem60@gmail.com"},"committer":{"name":"Hem Patel","email":"patelhem60@gmail.com"}},"repository":{"id":1356848983,"node_id":"R_kgDOUN_fVw","name":"PatelHem","full_name":"Hem60/PatelHem","private":false,"owner":{"login":"Hem60","id":227198061,"node_id":"U_kgDODYrEbQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/227198061?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hem60","html_url":"https://github.com/Hem60","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hem60/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hem60/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hem60/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hem60/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hem60/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hem60/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hem60/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hem60/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hem60/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hem60/PatelHem","description":"A self-classifying engineering portfolio. Instruments read the repositories, score them on five fixed axes, and publish a catalogue that revises itself. Every rank is computed; nothing is self-reported.","fork":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hem60/PatelHem","forks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hem60/Pa